## Labels (Axes - Titles - Legend) {.smaller}

::: {.columns}
::: {.column}



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
base_plot
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](r_w05_slides_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-15-1.png){width=960}
:::
:::



Use `labs()` to modify labels of plot, axes, legend.

:::
::: {.column .fragment}



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
p_labs <- base_plot + labs(
  x = "Sepal Length (cm)",
  y = "Petal Length (cm)",
  title = "Scatter plot with customized labels.",
  color = NULL # remove legend title
)
p_labs
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](r_w05_slides_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-16-1.png){width=960}
:::
:::



:::
:::

## Add Other Layers {.smaller}

::: {.columns}
::: {.column}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
# the scatter plot with modified lables
p_labs
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](r_w05_slides_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-17-1.png){width=960}
:::
:::


:::
::: {.column .fragment}

Add a linear regression line using `geom_smooth()`:



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
