## Themes {.smaller}

::: {.columns}
::: {.column}
- Built-in themes (`theme_*()`): `theme_grey()` (default),`theme_bw()`, `theme_light()`, `theme_classic()`, *etc.*



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
p_labs + theme_classic()
```
:::

::: {.cell}
::: {.cell-output-display}
![](r_w05_slides_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-26-1.png){width=960}
:::
:::



:::
::: {.column}
- Use `theme()` function to tweak elements, *e.g.*:



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
p_labs + theme(
  legend.position = "none", # hide legend
  plot.title = element_text(
    hjust = 0.5, # center plot title
    size = 40, # plot title size
  ), 
  axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 90) # rotate axis' text
)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](r_w05_slides_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-27-1.png){width=960}
